  {
   "id": "taboo-trial-259170@major-2024-06-10",
   "gameId": "taboo-trial-259170",
   "displayName": "6/10 Update (1)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-06-10T11:24:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear Player,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Greetings and Happy Dragon Boat Festival! We have prepared some token rewards for you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The contents of this update are as follows",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. After the battle with Mimir in Chapter 5, you now gain a large amount of experience based on the total damage dealt.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Fixed the issue where the level cap for the general rewards \"Fortification\" and \"Assault\" was not functioning. The level cap is now set to 50.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Fixed the issue where suppression damage was calculated incorrectly. Suppression damage multipliers now include a basic 100% increase.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Fixed the issue where the damage from the Dark Gold Ring's Flame Whirlwind could not trigger various Flame Whirlwind effects.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. Added code error protection for some special scenarios.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Note: To ensure the best gaming experience, please make sure you have downloaded the latest version of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
