  {
   "id": "taboo-trial-259170@major-2024-06-03",
   "gameId": "taboo-trial-259170",
   "displayName": "6/03 Update (1)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-06-03T02:57:27.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear players",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Ancient equipment can now be selected all at once. (For sets, dark gold, ancient items, necklaces, etc., you need to filter by the corresponding quality or item type to select them all, to prevent accidental deletion.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. Rune enhancement skills are now unique. Once a rune enhancement skill has been fused, it will no longer appear in the game. (Previously, selecting the same skill multiple times had no effect.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. The effect of Flame Tiger Kill has been adjusted to a fixed damage of 10% of weapon damage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Note: To ensure the best gaming experience, please make sure you have downloaded the latest version of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
