  {
   "id": "taboo-trial-259170@major-2024-06-02",
   "gameId": "taboo-trial-259170",
   "displayName": "6/2 Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-06-02T06:38:34.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear players",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. Fixed the issue where the Rune Fusion tutorial could not be completed, and provided partial compensation for players who reached a game difficulty of 5 or above.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. In the Spiritual Fountain - Divine Book, you can now choose to enhance normal attacks.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Ancient equipment and dark gold equipment now start dropping from difficulty 5.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. Adjusted the curve after difficulty 140, slightly increasing it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. The blessing skills: Scar Curse, Fury Termination, and dark gold rings: Tiger Courage and Dragon Might, their damage effects can now trigger critical hits and suppression. At the same time, the damage from Tiger Courage and Dragon Might will be counted as physical damage in the damage statistics interface (as they are converted from physical damage, this is just a display adjustment; they will still benefit from additional damage bonuses).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. Two new level talents have been added to the Spiritual Fountain: basic attack power and basic spell damage.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Note: To ensure the best gaming experience, please make sure you have downloaded the latest version of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
