  {
   "id": "taboo-trial-259170@major-2024-04-30",
   "gameId": "taboo-trial-259170",
   "displayName": "4/30 Update (1)",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-04-30T06:10:50.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Dear players",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. The effects of the Heavenly Guardian Set and the Phoenix Set have been adjusted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. The effects of the Raven Guardian Berserker's skills and other in-game shield-gaining skills have been adjusted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. The creation method of the Holy Vortex has been optimized. Now, excessive Holy Vortices will merge into a larger vortex.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. The effects of the Blessing skills Self-Sacrifice, Fast In and Out, Furious Killing Intent, Vortex Black Hole, Unyielding Struggle, Storm Resonance, and Curse Resonance have been adjusted.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. The Blessing skill Divine Protection has been added.",
