       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. The settings interface has added options to toggle screen vibration and weapon visibility. The settings interface offers various customization options, including camera adjustments, lock-on methods, damage number size, etc. It is recommended for new players to review and adjust these options to fit your own gaming preferences.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. Fixed the issue where switching weapons would cause a freeze after using a modded weapon.",
